her to List Builder or Power at any time?\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-gray-600\",\"children\":\"Yes, you can upgrade to any higher tier at any time. We will pro-rate and refund the remainder of the current billing period to your original form of payment.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"What is the difference between Researcher and List Builder?\",{\"className\":\"bg-white rounded-lg p-5 mb-5 border border-gray-200 shadow-sm max-w-[850px] mx-auto\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"text-xl mb-2\",\"children\":\"What is the difference between Researcher and List Builder?\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-gray-600\",\"children\":\"Researcher is free and lets you open any company profile, with a limited view of PrivCo's insight on each — the most recent year's revenue, employee count, news coverage, and funding events. List Builder unlocks the full profile: full historical financials, all available employee counts, key executive contact information, unlimited watchlists with alerts, and up to 1,000 company exports per month — everything you need to build and track an active acquisition list.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"What is the difference between List Builder and Power?\",{\"className\":\"bg-white rounded-lg p-5 mb-5 border border-gray-200 shadow-sm max-w-[850px] mx-auto\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"text-xl mb-2\",\"children\":\"What is the difference between List Builder and Power?\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-gray-600\",\"children\":\"List Builder gives you full company data, unlimited watchlists, key executives contact data and up to 1,000 company exports per month. Power adds all available employee contact information, 3,000 exports per month, API and MCP credits, a dedicated account manager, and access to PrivCo's research team. Power also supports group pricing and AP invoicing for teams.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"Do you offer a free trial?\",{\"className\":\"bg-white rounded-lg p-5 mb-5 border b